# SmartCampus — environment configuration
#
# Get an API key from Google Cloud Console → APIs & Services → Credentials.
# Enable these APIs on the project: Maps JavaScript API, Places API,
# Geocoding API (Directions/Routes API optional — see README).
#
# Leave this blank to run the app in DEMO MODE — the UI, custom map,
# markers, routing, and every feature will still work using local demo data.
VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=
